    "approvedEnglish": "I am a cat. I want to sleep. I look at the store. The store has a big door. I go to the door. I sit at the door. The door does not open. I am not happy.\n\nI look at the house. I go to the house. I see a dog at the house. The dog sits there. The dog looks at me. The dog says, \"I sit here. Do not sit here.\" I do not want the dog. I want to sleep. I am not happy.\n\nI look at the shop. I go to the shop. I see a woman at the shop. I sit near the woman. The woman looks at me. I say, \"I want to sleep.\" The woman says, \"You can sleep here.\" I am happy. I sleep at the shop. I like the shop. I like the woman. I am a happy cat.",
